  "prefLabel": "Plc 1501.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1501.02 Applicability. This chapter shall apply to any individual who intends to practice or who does actually practice respiratory care in New Hampshire, subject to the exceptions in RSA 326-E:6, reprinted in Appendix C.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 1500) #13496, INTERIM, eff 11-27-22; ss by #13621, eff 5-22-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 1500)",
